# Local-only token-minting / throwaway debug scripts — never publish (can mint
# real admin JWTs). Underscore prefix is this repo's convention for scratch
# scripts that must stay local; src/scripts/ also holds legitimate tracked
# production scripts, so only this narrow pattern is ignored.
src/scripts/_*.ts

